{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumper\u2019s Doom</strong> is a brutally challenging 2D retro platformer set in a haunting black-and-white world. Take control of the Jumpers and embark on a mission to save a planet drained of all color. Only the legendary Lotus Flower can restore life to this bleak and desolate land. Every jump is a risk. Every mistake means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/extras/7bc4a45e859d6a3fe9af0ec7b5286db8.avif?t=1753904630\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/extras_big/7bc4a45e859d6a3fe9af0ec7b5286db8.avif?t=1753904630 width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a real test of skill: deadly traps, tight platforming, and unforgiving level design. Unlock unique characters, each with their own visual style, and dive into local co-op mode. Play on the same screen with a friend or blame them after your hundredth death. This game doesn\u2019t just test your reflexes it tests your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/extras/14a4a2bd5563ddf6ea5b58ed066436fe.avif?t=1753904630\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/extras_big/14a4a2bd5563ddf6ea5b58ed066436fe.avif?t=1753904630 width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports resolutions: 1280\u00d7720, 1366\u00d7768, 1280\u00d7800, 1600\u00d7900, 1920\u00d71080, 2560\u00d71440, and 3840\u00d72160</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stylish pixel art, a grim atmosphere, and relentless pacing, <strong>Jumper\u2019s Doom</strong> is a must-play for fans of hardcore platformers. Jump, fight, die, and try again.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3784980/70f5c3bc2d72eb41da0be74a8487a6290c9e3506.jpg"},{"name":"Master collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3784980/700d6a547b4c76df7358eeec5a2361f473c6c09b.jpg"},{"name":"For the first time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3784980/9af03f86b63322f2b8de10f5f50d2badfb3e1d53.jpg"},{"name":"First meeting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3784980/4a119d2eaf892402c55ce2fbf8cc87493a224dd9.jpg"},{"name":"Keybound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3784980/8e11945d829bd62533b0f6885051092eb92ae090.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784980?t=1753904630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/8bcd5d0692ef64754a695fe4fd602f15b4f3b58f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753904630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/26d3012ccec37cbe50b31db7872a81ce8d238606/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753904630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/26d3012ccec37cbe50b31db7872a81ce8d238606/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753904630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos"