per\u2019s Doom</strong> is a must-play for fans of hardcore platformers. Jump, fight, die, and try again.</p>","developers":["PiariTech Studio "],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/da0f9d2cc3f60078f0245750d6a6c5dfb69cfea7/header.jpg?t=1753904630","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6006U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 520 / Radeon R5 M330<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1800 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GEFORCE GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784980/1405858804/770388d45508d805673c218c5ef6ae5537bc339a/1750375477/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749205011","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784980/1405858804/770388d45508d805673c218c5ef6ae5537bc339a/1750375477/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749205011","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784980/1405858804/770388d45508d805673c218c5ef6ae5537bc339a/1750375477/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749205011","id":257150553,"name":"Jumper's Doom triler","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150553/61755ba17ad34d8917cf92826cd40fb9b9cdedc5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749205011"}],"name":"Jumper's Doom","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","na